Aerie-Purpose: Give the Aerie Guard page the strings of its filter list rows: rule counts, ignored exception rules, update status, retry and list errors.
Aerie-Upstream-Area: chrome/browser/ui/webui/settings (settings_localized_strings_provider.cc)
Aerie-Kind: hook

Issue #104. The strings are in the overlay's aerie_guard_settings_strings.grdp, which
adblock/0022 already includes. This patch only hands each one to the Settings page, in the
function adblock/0022 added. A test compares the names with the grdp.

